EXPLANATION = {"title": "Chain Integrity", "principle": "Sequential C-alpha atoms stay within 4.5 Angstrom of each other.", "rationale": "The pinned code (definition v2, WP-SCI-1) measures the maximum CA(i)-CA(i+1) distance for immediately sequential same-chain residues (adjacent residue numbers, insertion codes honored); the pinned threshold is 4.5 A. Numbering gaps (missing spans) are skipped, not treated as physical chain breaks. WP-8: threshold and description aligned with the pinned code."}
